    <item>
      <title>Linux Distro Chooser</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/apps/distro-chooser/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 01:20:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/apps/distro-chooser/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;decide-on-the-perfect-linux-distro-for-you&#34;&gt;Decide on the perfect Linux distro for you!&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is a simple Linux Distro Chooser tool that I created to help people find the perfect Linux distribution for&#xA;their needs. It is based on my personal experience and recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;try-it-out&#34;&gt;Try it out!&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;script&#xA;  defer&#xA;  src=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.x.x/dist/cdn.min.js&#34;&#xA;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;link rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/css/minigame-styles.css?v=1774339727&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/js/distro-chooser.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box-mg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div x-data=&#34;distroChooser()&#34; class=&#34;distro-widget&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div x-show=&#34;step === 0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3&gt;Find the perfect Linux distribution for you!&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;&#xA;        Answer a few simple questions and get an answer, that&#39;s based on my&#xA;        experience and reccomendation.&#xA;      &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Web Metronome</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/apps/metronome/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 15:49:59 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/apps/metronome/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;metronome-web-app&#34;&gt;Metronome Web App&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is a simple metronome that runs directly on this page. You can set the tempo in beats per minute (BPM) using the input field above, and start or stop the metronome using the button.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;link rel=&#34;stylesheet&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/css/minigame-styles.css&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;box-mg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;form onsubmit=&#34;window.toggleMetronome(); return false;&#34;&#xA;    class=&#34;flex flex-col items-center gap-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;number&#34; id=&#34;bpmInput&#34;&#xA;        class=&#34;input-mg&#34;&#xA;        placeholder=&#34;BPM&#34; min=&#34;20&#34; max=&#34;500&#34; value=&#34;120&#34; required&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;ml-2 text-lg font-bold&#34;&gt;BPM&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;button-mg&#34;&gt;&#xA;      Toggle&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/form&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;script src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/%20js/metronome.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description>
    </item>
